# How to use GA4

- Package `@nu-art/ga4-frontend`: `ModuleFE_GA4`, `Ga4Controller`, `ModulePackFE_GA4`.
- Depends on `ConsentSource` (consent-shared) only. The app wires it with `ModuleFE_GA4.setConsentSource(ModuleFE_Consent)`.
- Config: `measurementId` (required to enable), `analyticsCategory` ('analytics'), `marketingCategory` ('marketing'), `sendPageView`.
- Call `ModuleFE_GA4.event(...)` / `pageView(...)` freely. They no-op without consent.

## Forbidden

- Do not add a gtag `<script>` to index.html. Only ModuleFE_GA4 loads it, after consent.
- Do not queue events before consent.
- Do not import `@nu-art/consent-frontend` from this lib.
